pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 48, 400, 20]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      wrap: false
      text: "01 — THE PROBLEM"
  - elementId: claim
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 84, 460, 158]
    content:
      style: "$claim"
      text: |
        <p>Every engineer already has AI tools.</p>
        <p>Adoption was never the bottleneck — <span style="color:$primary">guidance</span> is.</p>
  - elementId: claim-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 262, 440, 96]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p>Engineers have Copilot, Claude Code and Devin. What they lack is project-aware guidance: which workflow fits which task, and whether the AI output is actually correct.</p>
  - elementId: vline
    elementType: line
    bounds: [566, 90, 2, 350]
    viewBox: [2, 350]
    points: "1,0 1,350"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: stat1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [600, 78, 300, 62]
    content:
      style: "$bignum"
      wrap: false
      text: 90%
  - elementId: stat1-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [600, 140, 290, 42]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p>of developers use AI (DORA 2025); median 2 hours a day</p>
  - elementId: stat-sep1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [600, 192, 290, 2]
    viewBox: [290, 2]
    points: "0,1 290,1"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: stat2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [600, 204, 300, 62]
    content:
      style: "$bignum"
      color: "$warn"
      wrap: false
      text: "−7.2%"
  - elementId: stat2-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [600, 266, 290, 42]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p>delivery stability lost per 25% rise in AI adoption (DORA 2024)</p>
  - elementId: stat-sep2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [600, 318, 290, 2]
    viewBox: [290, 2]
    points: "0,1 290,1"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: stat3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [600, 330, 300, 62]
    content:
      style: "$bignum"
      color: "$warn"
      wrap: false
      text: "−19%"
  - elementId: stat3-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [600, 392, 290, 42]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p>speed for experienced devs on familiar code — while feeling 20% faster (METR 2025)</p>
  - elementId: src
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 490, 700, 30]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      text: |
        <p>Sources: DORA State of DevOps 2024 & 2025; METR randomized controlled trial 2025. Also: underspecified prompts cut first-try correctness by 20–30% (research brief, repo docs/research/evidence.md).</p>
  - elementId: pageno
    elementType: text
    bounds: [900, 500, 36, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: "02"
